This repository contains build tooling and documentation only.

The image and Magisk modules produced by the scripts here bundle third-party
components that are NOT licensed under this repository's LICENSE and are NOT
distributed in this repository:

  * LG Electronics proprietary firmware components extracted from LG V60 ThinQ
    stock firmware, including but not limited to:
    Ims6.apk, lgdataservice.apk, lge_ims_phone_provider, imsipsecclient,
    imsipsecstarter, ipsecd, libims.lge.so and other libims*.lge.so,
    LGDataFeature.so, libLgeProductProperties.so, LG framework .jar files,
    LG init .rc files, LG SELinux policy fragments, and the /etc/ipsec CA set.
    These are subject to LG's firmware license and may not be redistributed.

  * strongSwan binaries (charon, starter, stroke, libcharon.so, libstrongswan.so,
    libsimaka.so) as built by LG. strongSwan itself is GPLv2; the ABI adjustment
    to the `stroke` client is provided as a source patch
    (tools/strongswan-5.7.1-lg-stroke.patch).

  * com.google.android.iwlan and com.android.qns, originating from an
    AOSP/Google Android build. These are repackaged and re-signed by the build
    scripts; they are not redistributed here.

Users build the image and modules locally from their own LG V60 stock firmware
and a LineageOS system_ext image. Nothing proprietary is checked in.
